(7734747, 1274820, 38162, '<td valign="top">This vintage lens missed infinity so a bit soft in weird places. Not a moving grab shot with that composition.</td>', 'This vintage lens missed infinity so a bit soft in weird places. Not a moving grab shot with that composition.', '2022-12-16 11:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
