(7734752, 1274831, 113411, '<td valign="top">Anita..it was on a ramshackle, mess of a farm on the outskirts of Sarasota, Florida.<br/>These guys were in a field and someone must have called them in for food. When I got out of the car<br/>they looked straight at me..problem was my lens was not long enough and the quality was awful.</td>', 'Anita..it was on a ramshackle, mess of a farm on the outskirts of Sarasota, Florida.These guys were in a field and someone must have called them in for food. When I got out of the carthey looked straight at me..problem was my lens was not long enough and the quality was awful.', '2022-12-16 11:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7734753, 1274811, 91360, '<td valign="top">great flat lay image, as  Anita mentioned..this should be in the flat lay challenge:)</td>', 'great flat lay image, as  Anita mentioned..this should be in the flat lay challenge:)', '2022-12-16 11:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
